    "identifier": "ryu-conquerors-art-tyrants-impact",
    "description": "<p>You gather your draconic chakra into a large sphere above your head before it falls compressing down into a small sphere that floats in front of your mouth, waiting for you to bellow a dragons roar.</p>\n<p>All creatures in range must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failure, creatures take 3d10 damage and gain 1 rank of Weakened or half as much damage on a success.</p>\n<p>Dragon Rage State. If this jutsu is cast while in your Dragon Rage State, creatures that fail their saving throw by 5 or more take 5d10 damage instead.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above C-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage by 1d10.</p>",
